  description: "Attach a 3.5m psychic aura to an aimed ally, or yourself if no ally is selected, for 3.5 seconds. Pulses every 0.8 seconds, dealing special damage to enemies and healing the recipient. Hits reduce enemy Attack and Sp. Attack by 20% for 3 seconds, stacking up to 60%; overlapping Psychic auras use the strongest reduction rather than adding together. The recipient gains 15% Defense and Sp. Defense while the aura lasts. Upgrade: increases healing."
